			<div class="content" id="post-content-2264812">
									

<p><em>Remember me to one who lives there…</em></p>
<p>Listen to <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3iC-QdMjzVw">Scarborough Fair</a>. And then listen to <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H4lxlLbEZrs">Over the Hills and Far Away</a> because it’s awesome and also I listened to that while writing?</p>
<p>Many thanks to the people who read this in chat (and anyone I might have missed!): Conwell (more SH!), Gottagofeast (storyline), TwistedGears (less sads), DisquietRiot (less over-subtle), DrMann (proxies), Vince, LordDeath, Accelerando (SH development), lurkd , thedeadlymoose (SH!!!), Silber (he named this), rumetzen, Trar from wandererslibrary (for the fairy hunting), Wogglebug (inconsistency fixes), Eskobear (phrasing), Clef</p>
<p>I did quite a bit of Wikipedia research for this article. &gt;.&gt;</p>
<p>Why 2175? I looked up some Irish mythology. Someone can call me on this if I’m wrong, of course.<br />
21 = 3 x 7 (two lucky numbers)<br />
17 is said to be mystical.<br />
5 is significant and found in many designs.</p>
<p>The picture is from the <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Windsor_Bridge">Windsor Bridge Wikipedia article</a>, and licensed under <a href="http://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Main_Page">Wikimedia Commons</a>.</p>

